3</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8705213</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT5"><label>5</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>De la Rosette</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Witjes</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name><name><surname>Debruyne</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kersten</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wijkstra</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improved reliability of uroflowmetry investigations: Results of a portable home-based uroflowmetry study</article-title><source>Br J Urol</source><year>1996</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>385</fpage><lpage>90</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8881947</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT6"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pel</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>van Mastrigt</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of a low-cost flow meter to grade the maximum flow rate</article-title><source>Neurourol Urodyn</source><year>2002</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>48</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11835424</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Currie</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The streamtest cup: A new uroflow device</article-title><source>Urology</source><year>1998</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>1118</fpage><lpage>21</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9836566</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sonke</surname><given-nam